msgid "Android in-app purchases"
msgstr "Внутриигровые покупки на платформе Android"

msgid ""
"Godot provides the first-party `GodotGooglePlayBilling <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot-google-play-billing>`_ Android plugin for integrating the "
"`Google Play Billing library <https://developer.android.com/google/play/"
"billing>`_, enabling applications distributed through Google Play to offer "
"one-time purchases and subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"Godot предоставляет собственный плагин `GodotGooglePlayBilling <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot-google-play-billing>`_ для Android, позволяющий "
"интегрировать библиотеку `Google Play Billing <https://developer.android.com/"
"google/play/billing>`_, благодаря чему приложения, распространяемые через "
"Google Play, могут предлагать разовые покупки и подписки."

msgid ""
"For installation, setup instructions, and the API reference, see the "
"`GodotGooglePlayBilling documentation <https://godot-sdk-"
"integrations.github.io/godot-google-play-billing/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Инструкции по установке, настройке и справочник API см. в `документации "
"GodotGooglePlayBilling <https://godot-sdk-integrations.github.io/godot-"
"google-play-billing/>`_."
